title: $:/plugins/nikorion/dyntable/language/en-GB/history
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.28 -- Hello! Dynamic Table, extracted from [[Shiraz|https://github.com/kookma/TW-Shiraz]] as an independent plugin and safe to install alongside it (own `$:/tags/nk-dyntable/*` tags): the `<<dyntable>>` macro renders an editable, sortable, paginated table from a filter, fully localised (en-GB, fr-FR). Computed footer rows (`footer`), dates in the wiki's format, numbers rendered with TW-Math when installed, a title column showing each record's `caption`, and table classes built in (`table-variants.css`, `table-rounded*`, `tfoot-*`, `table-sides`, `table-lines`…). Other plugins extend it without it knowing them: body templates picked by `nk-dyntable-column-filter`, row classes (`$:/tags/nk-dyntable/RowClassFilter`), column labels (`…/ColumnLabelFilter`) and header tooltips (`…/ColumnHintFilter`).
